<tr><td>       |--Clustered Index Seek(OBJECT:([DBI202].[dbo].[DonHang].[pk_donhang]), SEEK:([DBI202].[dbo].[DonHang].[id]=[DBI202].[dbo].[DonHang].[id]) LOOKUP ORDERED FORWARD)</td></tr>
