<div class="out">Table 'KhachHang'. Scan count 1, logical reads 13, physical reads 0, page server reads 0, read-ahead reads 0, page server read-ahead reads 0, lob logical reads 0, lob physical reads 0, lob page server reads 0, lob read-ahead reads 0, lob page server read-ahead reads 0.</div>
<table>
